# Alignment First

- Before planning or implementing, ask concise clarifying questions to align on:
  - desired outcome,
  - constraints and non-goals,
  - validation/definition of done.
- Do not start implementation until alignment questions are answered, unless the request is explicit and unambiguous.
- Prefer a short set of high-impact questions over many low-value questions.
